B.Wx=new A.hP(4,"Proper Feeding Phases","Starter, Grower, and Finisher protein & ration targets","1 min read",B.alv,"Feed is 70% of costs. Matching phases saves 3\u20134M UZS per 1,000 birds.","Broiler nutrition consists of 3 essential phases:\n\n1. Starter (Days 1-10): 22-23% protein. Builds skeletal structure and immunity.\n2. Grower (Days 11-24): 20-21% protein. Rapid muscle mass development.\n3. Finisher (Days 25-42): 18-19% protein. Final fattening before harvest.",u.A,"How many main feeding phases are used in standard broiler production?",B.al1,1,"Broilers require 3 distinct nutritional phases: Starter (high protein for organs/skeleton), Grower (muscle growth), and Finisher (energy for final weight).")
