B.WA=new A.hP(2,"First 3 Days: The Critical Phase","Crop fill check, warm water, and chick behavior","1 min read",B.am0,"Good first 72 hours guarantees 180\u2013190g weight by Day 7 and strong immunity.","The first 72 hours determine the survival and growth of the entire flock.\n\n\u2022 Check crop fill after 8 hours: at least 80% of chicks must have feed and water.\n\u2022 Water temperature should be warm (20-22\xb0C).\n\u2022 If chicks huddle together \u2014 they are cold. If panting with open beaks \u2014 too hot.",u.d,"What percentage of chicks must have found water and feed within the first 8 hours?",B.au6,0,"According to Ross-308 standards, at least 80% of chicks should have full, soft crops 8 hours after placement to ensure uniform growth.")
B.Xi=new A.co(B.fC,"33\u201334\xb0C","Preheat 24 hours early","Warm air to 33\u201334\xb0C and floor bedding to 30\u201332\xb0C before chicks arrive.")
